    > for K eigenvalues — strictly worse than O(x^{1/2+eps}) summation when
    > K = sqrt(x); (iii) CCM's published B=6 → K=50 with err range
    > 10^{-55..-3} implies geometric per-zero error growth ~11.3x, yielding
